and resulting in cytokine secretion and the inflammatory response. Positively regulates the production of TNF (TNF) and interleukin-6 (IL6)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}